[{"id":168526759,"discussion_id":"3255c1e579eb4596041e575587e1d87bf8a13f22","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| image/grid_sample | ✅ [*liu-wei*](https://gitcode.com/liu-wei), [*gcw_kUomxQ2l*](https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l) (2/2) | ✅ [*gcw_kUomxQ2l*](https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n renruhai, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-16T15:49:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-17T17:17:45+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168526839,"discussion_id":"6c06d6bd71beb43fc19b198c4cd0142db0eeb451","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-16T15:50:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-16T15:50:00+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d30d60184036954b14e5","login":"renruhai","object_id":"6822d30d60184036954b14e5","name":"renruhai","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/renruhai"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168526863,"discussion_id":"c0e5b5c23e8cfe05c3ad61f3b86c35a8b640a823","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR修复了`GridSample`算子在特定架构（Arch35）下进行数据切分（tiling）时，线程模式选择逻辑不完善的问题。原逻辑仅依据输出张量的大小和维度来决定使用2D或3D线程模式，未考虑输入张量和网格张量的数据规模。这可能导致在输入或网格数据量过大时，选择不匹配的线程模式，从而影响计算性能或正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案的核心是引入输入张量和网格张量的规模评估，以完善线程模式的选择条件。具体修改包括：在tiling计算中新增并计算`inputSize`和`gridSize`变量；将线程数选择条件扩展为同时检查输出、输入和网格数据量是否超过阈值；并同步更新了tiling key的生成逻辑，使其与新的选择条件保持一致，确保数据量超限时使用正确的tiling策略。","created_at":"2026-04-16T15:50:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-16T15:50:08+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168527052,"discussion_id":"88ff749036b9956143fccd51d4548c6a31dc373f","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=5221dc81bdb145fdbd75243e550b8a32&pipelineRunId=54e0ba2dcf454b33a8f093dcee973fd2&projectName=CANN'>54e0ba2dcf454b33a8f093dcee973fd2</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=5221dc81bdb145fdbd75243e550b8a32&pipelineRunId=54e0ba2dcf454b33a8f093dcee973fd2&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-cv/package/732/cann-ops-cv_linux-x86_64.run>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n           